# Ambient cloud

At 43:00, Sam describes an ambient cloud: cloud accounts and credentials available through one Alchemy login.
He proposes a cloud wallet that manages API keys and cloud access. [Watch the moment](https://youtu.be/MtKHzAH6uXM?t=2580).

See [Sam Goodwin on Alchemy](/lore/devtools-fm-sam-goodwin-alchemy).
